sequenceDiagram
  participant P0 as Execution S11
  participant P1 as Assurance S12
  participant P2 as Probe worker
  participant P3 as Evidence S04
  participant P4 as Decision S10
  alt Required current prerequisites hold
    P0->>P1: 1 Request exact validation after effect
    P1->>P3: 2 Verify current approved probe policies
    P1->>P2: 3 Lease bounded independent probes
    P2->>P3: 4 Retain actual observations and provenance
    P2->>P1: 5 Submit fenced probe results
    P1->>P1: 6 Check every mandatory recovery criterion
    P1->>P4: 7 Publish justified validation and certification
    P4->>P0: 8 Use current outcome in subsequent decisions
  else A prerequisite fails or an external outcome is uncertain
    Note over P0,P4: Provider success alone is not recovery. Missing, stale or failed mandatory evidence prevents certification.
  end
